fixture storm_run
doc BUILD.md s13 Testing and CI, the proc storm (docs/adr/0020, Decision 15): the stress room's first 1800 ticks with the storm Votive set, which fires on every proc event, so a Kindle cone or a Radiance burst on a dozen dummies raises 300 to 525 procs in one tick. Played, reported and not gated by tools/bench/stress_bench.gd; the pin of its first ticks is tests/replay/perf/storm_pin.fixture.
